<title>UK: One of two Brent cargoes kept before deadline-trade.</title>
<headline>One of two Brent cargoes kept before deadline-trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of the two Brent cargoes passing through the paper chains on Wednesday was kept before the five o' clock deadline by Phibro, traders said.</p>
<p>The other cargo, also due to load in the June 5-7 loading range was still being passed through the chains, they added.</p>
<p>--Siobhan Hayden London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
